==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|psycho-|analysis}}, after {{der|en|de|Psychoanalyse}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|psychoanalysis}} a form of psychotherapy invented by Austrian neurologist Sigmund Freud to treat a person's psychological problems based on free association between psychotherapist and patient and on recovering childhood memories, and theories about childhood sexual development such as the Oedipus complex. 

